## Import

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/sapintegrationsuite_api_product/import.sh" }}

The ID is the product's name. Everything is recovered, including linked proxies and additional
properties.

## Limitations

- **SAP:** products cannot be changed after creation; additional properties can only be sent with
  the create request.
- **Provider:** `version`, `title`, `is_published` and `is_restricted` take the values SAP sets
  when left out (version `1` on the tested tenant).

